The '''Ironman's Guild''' is a [[Location]] in the [[Dwarven Mines]], located above {{Zone|The Lift}}. It serves as an introduction to the [[Ironman]] gamemode.

== Purpose ==
{{NPCSprite|Ian}} introduces the player to [[Ironman]] and lets the player create an [[Ironman]] profile. {{NPCSprite|Ivan}} informs the player of the ability to 'de-iron' a profile, where an Ironman profile can be converted into a regular one. {{NPCSprite|Ivy}} talks more about Ironman.

